#: luci-app-vantage/root/usr/share/rpcd/acl.d/luci-app-vantage.json:25
msgid ""
"Vantage dashboard: client names from reverse DNS (lets the holder make the "
"device send DNS PTR queries to any DNS server and port it names)"
msgstr ""
"Vantage 仪表盘：来自反向 DNS 的客户端名称（持有者可使设备向其指定的任意 DNS "
"服务器和端口发送 DNS PTR 查询）"

#: luci-app-vantage/root/usr/share/rpcd/acl.d/luci-app-vantage.json:33
msgid ""
"Vantage dashboard: name stations and keep a station's weak signal out of the "
"warnings (luci.vantage set_alias and set_quiet: validated names and quiet "
"MACs in /etc/config/vantage only, at most 512 each)"
msgstr ""
"Vantage 仪表盘：命名站点，并将站点的弱信号排除在警告之外（luci.vantage "
"set_alias 和 set_quiet：仅将校验后的名称和静默 MAC 写入 /etc/config/vantage，"
"各至多 512 条）"

#: luci-app-vantage/root/usr/share/rpcd/acl.d/luci-app-vantage.json:3
msgid ""
"Vantage dashboard: read-only status of the device, uplink, radios and "
"stations (wireless configuration without keys, through luci.vantage "
"wireless), its temperature sensors (luci.vantage thermal), the wired hosts "
"its bridges have learned (luci.vantage wired: MAC, port and when last heard, "
"and which switch ports a port's VLAN has), the link state of those switch "
"ports (luci getSwconfigPortState), the default route the kernel takes to the "
"internet (luci.vantage routes: family, device and metric, no gateways) and "
"each radio's noise floor (luci.vantage survey: the channel survey read "
"through nl80211)"
msgstr ""
"Vantage 仪表盘：设备、上行链路、射频与站点的只读状态（经 luci.vantage "
"wireless 读取无线配置，不含密钥），温度传感器（luci.vantage thermal），网桥已"
"学习到的有线主机（luci.vantage wired：MAC、端口、最后一次收到的时间，以及某端"
"口的 VLAN 包含哪些交换机端口），这些交换机端口的链路状态（luci "
"getSwconfigPortState），内核去往互联网所走的默认路由（luci.vantage routes：协"
"议族、设备和跃点数，不含网关），以及各射频的底噪（luci.vantage survey：经 "
"nl80211 读取的信道勘测）"

